    {
      "id": "MLY6TLjF-1qG_cKSBFKmS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -222.0147063723698,
      "y": 313.34889775212037,
      "width": 695.6635131835938,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bF9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 434946534,
      "version": 1668,
      "versionNonce": 334884154,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762541543998,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional \n- Users can add/edit/delete recipes\n- Recipes have a titlte, body, image, prepTime, tags, ingredients list, and labels\n- User recipes are stored in the backend and the app. \n- Recipes can be updated from multiple clients associated to the user.\n- Users can generate a weekly meal plan based on their recipe collection.\n- The meal plan will produce a grocery list\n- Users need to be authenticated\n\nOut of scope:  (will be addressed but not now)\n- Browsing other people's recipes, recipe sharing\n- Push notifications\n- List ordering by grocery sections\n- Ingredient classification: when adding ingredients do FTS to suggest ingredients,\neach ingredient will be associated with an allergenic (eg. nuts), diet style (eg. vegan), \ngrocery store section (eg. produce) << out of scope but factor into DB choidce decision\n- Grocery store list ordered from produce to frozen.\n- Web Client to add/edit recipe collection\n- Pagination is out of scope for now\n\nNon-Functional\n- Users can access their recipes, meal plans and grocery shopping lists offline \n- App should be snappy \n- App and BE should be built to support 10 M MAU\n- Syncing of BE data with App should be efficient and not waste resources. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional \n- Users can add/edit/delete recipes\n- Recipes have a titlte, body, image, prepTime, tags, ingredients list, and labels\n- User recipes are stored in the backend and the app. \n- Recipes can be updated from multiple clients associated to the user.\n- Users can generate a weekly meal plan based on their recipe collection.\n- The meal plan will produce a grocery list\n- Users need to be authenticated\n\nOut of scope:  (will be addressed but not now)\n- Browsing other people's recipes, recipe sharing\n- Push notifications\n- List ordering by grocery sections\n- Ingredient classification: when adding ingredients do FTS to suggest ingredients,\neach ingredient will be associated with an allergenic (eg. nuts), diet style (eg. vegan), \ngrocery store section (eg. produce) << out of scope but factor into DB choidce decision\n- Grocery store list ordered from produce to frozen.\n- Web Client to add/edit recipe collection\n- Pagination is out of scope for now\n\nNon-Functional\n- Users can access their recipes, meal plans and grocery shopping lists offline \n- App should be snappy \n- App and BE should be built to support 10 M MAU\n- Syncing of BE data with App should be efficient and not waste resources. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
