      "seed": 1197767526,
      "version": 344,
      "versionNonce": 1084457408,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762801260140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Offline and Datamodel \n- How to sync changes between clients and BE\n- Sync conflict resolution\n- Generating Mealplans on the app vs BE. \n    - Explore later, but most likely App for now. \n- Generating Ingredients list\n    - Generate along with meal paln genearation. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Offline and Datamodel \n- How to sync changes between clients and BE\n- Sync conflict resolution\n- Generating Mealplans on the app vs BE. \n    - Explore later, but most likely App for now. \n- Generating Ingredients list\n    - Generate along with meal paln genearation. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EtSMeS9p0Nu3OCZNLYGFe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1287.1822236379594,
      "y": 325.6559799844826,
      "width": 1132.8792724609375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1460030778,
      "version": 344,
      "versionNonce": 28115322,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762542241756,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The app will have a Data Layer (Nav, Compose UIs + View Models), Domain Layer (Entities, Repo interfaces), and a \nData layer with Repositories, Data Source, and BE Sync Logic. \nThe DB will the SSOT and the app will follow UDF principles. Hilt used for DI.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The app will have a Data Layer (Nav, Compose UIs + View Models), Domain Layer (Entities, Repo interfaces), and a \nData layer with Repositories, Data Source, and BE Sync Logic. \nThe DB will the SSOT and the app will follow UDF principles. Hilt used for DI.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
